# Local pre-edit safety copies (<name>.bak-<YYYY-MM-DD>-<purpose>, per AGENTS.md).
# Their content is always recoverable from git history, so they must never be
# committed — the vendored kernel dist is the one place a stale copy would be
# mistaken for the live snapshot.
*.bak-*
.git-commit-msg.tmp
